  "details": "String 22515 \"No Avatars\" are currently using in two menu:\n\n1. In Wing menu > Avatars, when there are no recently used/favorited avatars available, there will show \"No avatars\" with a UFO icon;\n\n2. In QM > Report > Report an avatar, when there are no other users in the same instance, there will show \"No avatars\" with a Disable icon.\n\nThese two places express different idea, as \"Your avatar list is empty\" and \"Other users' avatars are not currently available\", so I suggest split this string into two.",
